# =============================================================================
#  HARLEY QUINN - MAIN MENU IDLE LOOP  ("Psycho")          Roblox R15 / MrXen0 rig
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
#  HOW TO USE
#    1. Open your MrXen0_R15RIG .blend in Blender (5.0+ recommended).
#    2. Scripting workspace -> Text Editor -> New -> paste this whole file.
#    3. Press  Run Script  (Alt+P).  Done - the armature now has the action
#       "HarleyQuinn_Idle_Psycho" assigned and the timeline set to 60 fps, frames 0-360.
#
#  WHAT IT DOES
#    * deletes any old "HarleyQuinn_Idle_Psycho" action first (no lingering keyframes)
#    * sets the rig to FK mode (ARM_IK_FK / LEG_IK_FK = 0)
#    * keys ONLY the animated FK controls (full-body loop, so legs/pelvis are keyed)
#    * all curves BEZIER + AUTO_CLAMPED, with a Cycles modifier so the loop seam
#      is smooth (frame 360 == frame 0)
#
#  TIMING (60 fps):   360 frames = 6.0 s
#    stance  : hunched, staggered, pigeon-toed; she rocks forward/back over her feet (120 f cycle)
#    arms    : limp pendulum dangle (left 120 f swing, right 180 f swing - they never line up)
#    58-150  : silent giggle fit - right hand to chin, left hand clutches chest, shoulders quiver
#    160-250 : head creeps toward a crooked tilt while her fingers twitch (irregular, smooth flicks)
#    250-265 : head snaps to the opposite tilt, body jolts, arms swing through on momentum
#    265-360 : lingers, eyes on camera, eases home
#
#  This is a FULL-BODY loop (idle display) - export it as a Looped animation and do
#  NOT apply the upper-body-only bone filter.
# =============================================================================
